say|KUSAKAM|Kusakam. I'm looking for my family's relic — and the ones who stole it.
say|MALIK|Malik, a humble merchant. Get me out of here, and at my humble place every one of you gets gold. Lots of gold.
say|MALIK|Alright — come with me!
